TY  - JOUR
TI  - Digital twin-based design and simulation frameworks for manufacturing engineering enabling virtual prototyping and lifecycle optimization
AU  - Ebubechukwu Ozurumba
AU  - Emeka Igwe
AU  - Chukwunonso Augustine Ikedionu
AU  - Nkemdi Amajoh
