TY  - JOUR
TI  - Integration of Six Sigma and simulations in real production factory to improve performance – a case study analysis
AU  - Ali Najah Ahmed
AU  - John Olsen
AU  - John A. Page
PY  - 2022
T2  - International Journal of Lean Six Sigma
